Modified Version
----------------
The Vietnamese extension — 134 characters — is a Modified Version of the Font
Software, generated by the `vietfont` tool.

The Modified Version is the font binaries and font design data under
`fonts/departure-mono-viet/`:

    build/DepartureMonoViet-Regular.otf        release build
    build/DepartureMono-Viet.otf               hand-built reference build
    build/DepartureMono-Viet.sfd               FontForge source of the above
    build/DepartureMonoLigaZ-Regular.{otf,ttf} ligature variant
    marks.json                                 mark shapes composed into the builds
    font-src/DepartureMono-Regular.otf         original font, unmodified
    research/DepartureMonoLigatures-Regular.otf original ligature build

Every font binary above carries the original copyright notice and this license
in its name table (nameID 0, 13, 14). A standalone copy of the license sits
beside them at `fonts/departure-mono-viet/OFL.txt`.

The OFL text specifies no Reserved Font Name, so the derivative name
"Departure Mono Viet" is permitted under clause 3.

